title: $:/nikorion/language/en-GB/About/

Intro: This wiki is a digital garden: a set of notes grown out of a personal knowledge management (PKM) practice. The content reflects personal needs and choices, is not exhaustive and keeps evolving. The notes are written to stay understandable and reusable by others.
TermsHeading: ! Digital garden and PKM
Garden: ''Digital garden'' names the publishing stance, from the reader's side: what you find here is shareable, unfinished, tended over time.
Pkm: ''PKM'' names the practice and the system, from the author's side: how knowledge is collected, organised, linked and found again.
Rule: The digital garden is the shape this PKM takes: //garden// for what is shown, //PKM// for what makes it all work.
